# Stack Test
# Molybdenum (Mo) — real density 10.28 g/cm³. three cubes stacked — simulate: collapse checks the load path.
scene "Molybdenum Stack Test"

bottom = cube 20mm color: #54b5b5 at (0, 10mm, 0)
middle = cube 20mm color: #54b5b5 at (0, 30mm, 0)
top = cube 20mm color: #54b5b5 at (0, 50mm, 0)
